{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1473,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d5af4af0a6c677b3e6d866",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…已经，可以吃了吗…？\n随心所欲地…呵呵，\n呵呵呵呵呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "061c88a55ae5b98380c2945dde582916fc6afb737959d6ec7b2fc2cb3226fa49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:005a11afcedb5f7b66200cc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…必须道谢呢。\n因为您邀请我参加了\n佳肴满席的美妙宴会…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f2aed8c5cafb6e21ca780a1cea051de9cb72737e79f43a1b77bfedb5ad5d186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:166c263bff62a38ecb1bb077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锻炼出的双腿，是我的武器…\n那孩子的獠牙。必定…取得\n第一名，回来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49dd97680080f98765927d77c5668c16e915028960e40eaef9c153c4616c270f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49fd4fe6897c0c41a18a5eac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们，或许是两人一起养育了\n怪物…即便如此，\n也好。只要能为您带来胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "13a370b132c360b59cbc8b3622fd3cbb0c95fde671ecee04e7d26fc7a1fd2f9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2197857d59cc8b93db082df8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有吗。强大的孩子，快速的孩子\n…美味的孩子…啊哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3857d312c7db98551b1eade9284eff7e525023d0202b4be15c1a123a6cd250ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a61a18d04040ee3285a28a89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…您在担心我吗？\n没关系的…那孩子，\n獠牙也没有失去…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e077289b77869adaba5929125cd2190742537284b6be2ee3fa35faac63fd3793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c83192c31d8c9e520f85300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我，我们可以战斗。\n…即使无法相信自己，\n也能相信您。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beeac73f35bd0b17586035f67d1811bc17e769c3be5312bc4e15510f5711151e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c550de16b0d6866fd045664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请您不必担心…\n您所做的事情\n的正确性，我会证明给您看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa106e5e79a0cbb20a274a3c11aaa553d49be5534245e59ee7688e0c4230f5e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0941cf446967cc48ce945b17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和您在一起就没有可怕的东西…\n即使…等待的是\n深渊也罢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "31bf95add9508cf87f58ed0861f279ca68558dc1fbe86a31def76e656f33f894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02615c75987e875f5641debf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…可以牵住我的手吗。\n那样的话一定…\n颤抖也会停止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c104cd61d6bb9c4a2a065e75d83f89d24a392ea9a0fcff6b44b23383f9e051",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdffa77ff448d799d17000e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那孩子，失去了力量…\n那么…即使只有我一个人，\n也必须努力试试看…",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c9c56644c139a58719f370d43e099f379c91cd930e0e6478c7633ff4522988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae4a6ba0be98e9babfd1536",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么…",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc8b3bbf8422f96e189bd9ae9705736aadf5c9e12b7881060b16d27deea4060e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef88eb0dee0563c7f105723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8cd473f45c92a27ecc35ef1018638325f32b3e17271b4d7b8d451388c2d29dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0deb64523124af243beb0c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7990e29ba73adbb25caf3a56bd6650d89178b313c21bbc997967b4db791ccd69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1d9ce8f12cc4a6577b603d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么…",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc8b3bbf8422f96e189bd9ae9705736aadf5c9e12b7881060b16d27deea4060e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:832b54fca57fca669699cc9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1b0cdc14da066d58dfe3b939cf0f73449b37886c84d86b22b3923b42d04d0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d26982cda63cd9e0c41e0c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55d62764ccc18450bc29a87356c49484cd31be597f6410d65689ef109e2fc74d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f47a920fdc076bb6ce38699",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cf8179495fb289eabd0217fa3c6e98bab4806a995603bdb060d70b25708b33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a437ca9ed6f70a87ada03842",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好美…",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bf05df74f97ca9a9e38aaac811431ceb39baac2d69b797ed2ef6104b7b302ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8effc42fc7b11bb6cfbfebb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正是在您身边才有我们的幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6a60a4a024bfe32be9d82037ba8a4984fc3482ab0ce8baed74369f3058386f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75dd1833f0313bb31aca2536",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙关照，非常感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f08dff13b56cc6eab7a156fba2f9f4c13368ae7f8a61318acbbf52bdbe0863",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3634296cd4381b8adb3b72a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是的…如果我可以的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af037b0c2ec640dc19131fe31a0791400dca5fbf0707ba70dd7431090a7f0639",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1abf5cd108ea1de2f297c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…要出来了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b24766b4b5dbfc8d7067501a98df3c0dfb2f510819c16200e2586ce6b4e8713",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e71753f062dfa7a786a1963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最美味的家伙…是我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "472753229542a3eb5b14beb74d33447b5fa0c7ede12709e07b3dd3bb5bd5baae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a55b0c53aa4d4410e54898b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙关照，非常感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f08dff13b56cc6eab7a156fba2f9f4c13368ae7f8a61318acbbf52bdbe0863",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7aee8c974d8c23de2d9e25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…必须道谢呢。\n因为您邀请我参加了\n佳肴满席的美妙宴会…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f2aed8c5cafb6e21ca780a1cea051de9cb72737e79f43a1b77bfedb5ad5d186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8311525625c8e413611c4efc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一定会抑制不住…想要展露\n卑劣丑陋的模样…只有您，\n会接受我吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d9823a9ad01d3ac1a10c2fdcdda0cf105d3332fe8be3fff458aade418f9c0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e807231a69ee43d5884e796",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承蒙关照，非常感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f08dff13b56cc6eab7a156fba2f9f4c13368ae7f8a61318acbbf52bdbe0863",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96eb7e0872a00d7239cb9d5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8cd473f45c92a27ecc35ef1018638325f32b3e17271b4d7b8d451388c2d29dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b09e065223bc066e5634e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！接下来，是打算…吞噬到底呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "27fb5e7474cbe442c8a7b5a04a14ee7192b2af2d63912ee64d9230a83720ef86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e47f779aedfd3a75cd56a03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腿在颤抖呢…。还想，更狂暴一些吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5bd66b415e37eda9f24c26c1e76f9a8b6ea21647af8862ac326f055078035cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd801d81f943cf4424e2c16b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直，还没吃够…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff71c824c525d1dc94427c2c3a8c3cdd25362480608534a495ea0b9f8917b5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10eca069d978be2bbd518377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果那孩子不狂暴的话…就这样吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "446815848b4120a598cda117aa92a388d025833a678b68a8b6e247ff9dca6c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f76394dfaa894890d48d678",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美妙的全套大餐…\n直到最后一滴，都享受到了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7659272617d22921b931299cbe5e93215c60e78ffeec65ac1ffa5f5ebc5b29e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcf11d7d3ff323cef3a6127b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢精彩的比赛…甜美的灵魂，多谢款待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a1371729a43c9090eb357de29ac7f6821e2f1c234ceb6a1e7f3863711817e23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed2eaebafe1b20cf3b2a527",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍不住了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3600d3dcfb490427dbc8c310bf1b77deec1335b4781d424acc231a2bf2e8f8a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84fde8c016c24e8ae85d96c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我…！你的全部！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9182d993230b43f3b2977e4d856df7a657733738d3e8bfb7bba19bb781331f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f8e4e703fd45e1b8393a27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…多么美丽…一切…所有…全部…\n好想全部吞噬殆尽…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c76e93322b69a6ed08839d4ee6c501cc5a101bba6d8a92f9e3bc3103a7daca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3277f4aef8fc9013d34876af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若能给舞台增添华彩…",
      "source_fingerprint": "478215a4ef5b6cf33d07d0382d9da4910b88d4d9954f894a0ad0079b8289fcf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fc1877ebfdabfb7df194e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，前往令人目眩的盛宴…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f60348a938f22e92fd4ad2ac59147ad5829254400028adc853a08a4ffbfcadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64645af3b6fd97ac6c6ba8cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是与您一起，无论何处都…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b952e3ab2917f418ad23c8638d0c6ce3f6a830d95ae78f95607a87a1ef14b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99783305c4cb38872d4bc807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有您的我，已经无法想象\n那个时候…被吞噬灵魂的\n或许是我…",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e6c4bdec10adc8e3417fa83b2c91d466dcb9c04de25caf75892b67b0161f82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa4811437f7fd6594e23f1d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情紧绷起来…\n为了不展现出不得体的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c03c670acb6c3b2bbbe8b1bacb501999baeba4ce0eacff1740f742a52b84445",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:349bb6baddc87041d0cecfe2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常可爱的服装…令人害羞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae127d7033b9b73695de8efea1425873fc938a39681e7ad65fd01306763e2bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0638537cbe1cf602b3dd10c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这副模样，能成为您的骄傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1231c1e94264701489eff9a3a18500c410cb6c301f38d717e7f70d9f6100ce6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df1a666f0ed249be408a28f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服让人安心呢。\n因为我不喜欢…展现个性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eea4d824bb1d9f4172711d59df92ca0cf4bd2fd2ed7441bbfddb095818038b30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc729174d50aa41359f18fd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要给粉丝们展现美好的笑容…呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "589a6ce9e07d5ff834df073e40a7f2773d3243c458bc3ca0eedfa9c5e1338db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:129e1994939eb28110d750e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这里，必须隐藏…卑劣的本性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14d5cb7223956131cbb3a215ff9dbc9d5fb91a7da08f9b23a7d5d68329c3fcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f31130f59629b783047ec8de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使装扮成各种模样…\n其中潜藏的东西，不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddad92dc5a8d92d703fbc3af8a2d072f62da7e5c98107023a51b79d5d62599fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4dfdb34ac55c700bf2b2369",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装是映照自我的镜子…现在的我，看起来如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cc4f041511fa3dbe6ec80cf2191fc839150786c711f997f6b9dea0257454412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40d9f4f5e415bc58a3470e00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这种地方穿便服…总觉得\n好像变成了不良少女呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d2466f7c264b888798f254956a24e509d47101569a083b491862e674beb8554",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91370a3163501c820050d867",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果您有时间的话…\n出去散散步之类的，如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be8d300406134bc36ffdf64b28ca8bc844e46dd75004c70ac084f849142c31c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:199ecedb830ae97474de5e43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情紧绷起来…\n为了不展现出不得体的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c03c670acb6c3b2bbbe8b1bacb501999baeba4ce0eacff1740f742a52b84445",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ddc932c601096369bb97be5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "非常可爱的服装…令人害羞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae127d7033b9b73695de8efea1425873fc938a39681e7ad65fd01306763e2bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d38bf37a9b56eca2a7ed52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这副模样，能成为您的骄傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1231c1e94264701489eff9a3a18500c410cb6c301f38d717e7f70d9f6100ce6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:151d61a95ee9e1d1338a8b15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服让人安心呢。\n因为我不喜欢…展现个性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eea4d824bb1d9f4172711d59df92ca0cf4bd2fd2ed7441bbfddb095818038b30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de17b44100eb1560d390d0a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要给粉丝们展现美好的笑容…呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "589a6ce9e07d5ff834df073e40a7f2773d3243c458bc3ca0eedfa9c5e1338db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a03b44a57ec770c00f69aa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这里，必须隐藏…卑劣的本性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14d5cb7223956131cbb3a215ff9dbc9d5fb91a7da08f9b23a7d5d68329c3fcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310fd15b334c5749ad48251f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使装扮成各种模样…\n其中潜藏的东西，不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddad92dc5a8d92d703fbc3af8a2d072f62da7e5c98107023a51b79d5d62599fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff9a7e688c5afb86f1fed31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装是映照自我的镜子…现在的我，看起来如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cc4f041511fa3dbe6ec80cf2191fc839150786c711f997f6b9dea0257454412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a0c336718b5f5444124d82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦您了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c971fa6ea4bd07e506c244e4115372e39db5db3b686990ee28d3d7e606174dd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45d9ff6ea9a58deb6a6e357",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。从清晨\n就能见到您…仿佛内心的阴霾\n都被照亮般的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7458ccbf8c67be9b0417ea5b6e63de58bce4a6a4800e5cb8b11545f2b1fcdee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a291b0f20c17fb30a334caf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜…阳光变得强烈了呢\n或许…想稍微\n到阴凉处去…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f77ba7091435d6e8728b6e0c0611a19c07291ecace9fcd07a4377e8e86511467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ba6227d8ee77ca21f6da427",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐时，定时器是必须的\n…没有的话，细细品味的时候\n休息时间就会结束…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f785189bb0193557b8b777d0c5038ec0312f725fc29989b4e4bb7b13208aae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8f1546071622066074ada2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了些点心，如果您愿意\n请品尝…如果合您口味…\n我会非常…幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8f52cd65e3e7efd32fee71f9628575d18447b58911751cb51fb0f580d68cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9215a44190f51f447bf7420b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想和您静静眺望每日变换身姿的月亮\n但满月之时，或许会\n唤醒那孩子呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5e12ef27ece7be8449d5dbeb261aa7e2cdf2f154281525c5bd3ebe307a74f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9959bfd43bb728c714fd059c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚，很温柔…\n不想被看见的东西，\n也会被夜幕隐藏…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db9ce775e1fc18b2338b52c93f6134b1ccc72ec574a4fdd3e1600af3399a46a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90d91cba589d57ba75e2a12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春夏秋冬的轮回，再次开始…\n…无论季节如何变迁，在您心中\n是否有我的容身之处…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "692d9379bcf30cdc3fd920172ad84dba0e79b944db19f4b655b363008ee13d55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d32c48c28dff6890aefafc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暂时要避免无意中站在暗处\n…那个，试胆的季节\n尤其…容易被误认为是幽灵…",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9196f0edb1a52043402938bdabed456129acc80a3aa1f8a127690db83d4bb45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172dca90515bc423252b1dd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天真短暂呢…美味的东西\n太多，正用舌头品味的时候\n季节就结束了…啊啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be62732837e16269cea28cc92ed1ea1a0e9dda31a08eaca7dd51b0cf8dd8eb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57a813c18262c064da7b0540",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "并不冷。\n…只要看到您的脸，\n我的身体就会温暖起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7961f8a1b5f0675007d1cafa09e0a0ce6603055af2b56398ab1ca210fe7f7fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4f6e4890f561ac61d59a44b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea94d22b6e9ee294e77a1e68223efc98be55a845b0b5c2d3268a0dc5899f8a5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f187a06098601026bbd37f20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…真是困扰呢。每次看到高峰同学，\n就有某种东西炙烤着内心…\n啊啊，一想起来，又…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "518d487c48b8eaa54fe7ec903c58e60ecbd51960a1ccc10b1bdb2f84760405d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0049585c5a3e06a6144e8e15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和新宇宙同学一起仰望星空时…\n仿佛要融入闪烁的夜空一般…\n感觉很舒适…",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca903ec54059c1b3b16e13ce0fb936f3a14b3b2ffc5bdec25a8bd5362e518853",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf1ffeaf2c41797d53977c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Tomatur☆Amaryllis！…呵呵。\n是东商同学想出的让番茄汁\n变美味的咒语哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bbeb7a5a9e77a973c2425b6ffef981692ab3a5cc49ec7fa79fedd9bc41967ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b449d667fde43532b2db1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甜美的点心，浓郁的咖啡…\n是款待中不可或缺的，\n魔法道具呢。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bccb76de3ec2445eeee23b4e4e205eca636c1d36235b5aeb1d0db0bc481a2036",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bbd982d0ccd8b857fbc601f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜欢在书海中让心灵畅游幻想\n…特别是历史小说会将我\n带往古老的时代。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b61bcd116903fa371d5090ca23b7f083d5d0356f101be9f62e49c7b34a87672",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10a55c507b3147fb4bacd590",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站在舞台中央虽然令人害羞\n但…必须表现得大方呢。\n为了让前来的人们能够享受…",
      "source_fingerprint": "48709d0dea67751d2be7b971764cfc1a8f753035dbad943d74f9c6acbef2acd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46f675fad9a670dac60c0b42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如此华丽的服装…\n能掩盖住吗。\n我内心深处的东西…",
      "source_fingerprint": "71440551fbe7a06b0c78c269593081ddee1d54f7f2d9a8e89ab8e4c876810920",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1526be45db9792d459c181f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…不行…在这种地方\n这副模样…啊啊…已经…\n抑制不住了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6033201e1074b5c758661d0d531c8fb40cde409769d283b2757aa3afe602494c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "91007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
